# IB Flex Web Service creds for the PAPER account — used by scripts/pull_paper_flex.py
# to backfill paper NAV history into derived_data/nav/paper_nav.csv (blive owns paper).
#
# One-time setup in the PAPER account's IB Account Management:
#   Reporting -> Flex Queries -> new ACTIVITY STATEMENT query; INCLUDE the
#     "Net Asset Value" / "Change in NAV" (Equity Summary) section; period e.g.
#     "Last 90 Calendar Days". Save -> note the Query ID.
#   Reporting -> Flex Web Service -> generate a token.
#
# Then copy this file to  ~/.blive/secrets/ib_flex.env  and fill in:
IB_FLEX_TOKEN=YOUR_PAPER_FLEX_TOKEN
IB_FLEX_QUERY_ID=YOUR_PAPER_QUERY_ID
